      "body": "United Breweries Limited announced the launch of Kingfisher Smooth, a strategic innovation that expands the Kingfisher portfolio within India's mainstream strong beer segment. Designed for younger legal-age consumers who enjoy strong beers, it offers an unprecedented strong and smooth drinking experience. Kingfisher Smooth is now available across Rajasthan, one of India's strong beer-consuming states, offering a more sessionable and approachable experience. Brewed using imported hops and containing no added sugar, it delivers a smooth, balanced taste while retaining the strength consumers expect. Kingfisher Smooth will be available across leading retail outlets in Rajasthan and will be priced at INR 100 for a 330 ml bottle, INR 145 for a 500 ml can, and INR 185 for a 650 ml bottle.",
